<title>SINGAPORE: CityDev proposes S$250 mln bond issue.</title>
<headline>CityDev proposes S$250 mln bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>City Developments Ltd said on Tuesday it proposed to issue Singapore $250 million of unsecured bonds with coupon rate of five percent.</p>
</text>
